# The hero's weapon and circlet (HeroWeapon, HeroCirclet) at a Monument of Heroes, asked by a character that is
# not a hero: the monument offers it only the page that names the hero of the era, which links neither
# feature, so both bypasses are refused (the bypass check) and nothing is given.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (OlympiadManagerNpc.showChatWindow) and replay the
# reference trace.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/hero_items_non_hero.golden
character Walker 76
script script.feature.HeroWeapon
script script.feature.HeroCirclet
item 6842 6611
page olympiad/
npc monument 31690 OlympiadManagerNpc 40 0 0

action monument
action monument
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=monument item=0 page=olympiad/hero_main2.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{monument}_Quest HeroWeapon
bypass npc_{monument}_Quest HeroCirclet
  items 6842=0
